```

### Extract file list
```bash
grep "^diff --git" brake-hold.patch | cut -d' ' -f3 | sed 's/^a\///'
```

### View statistics
```bash
diffstat brake-hold.patch
```

### Count changes
```bash
grep "^+" brake-hold.patch | wc -l  # Lines added
grep "^-" brake-hold.patch | wc -l  # Lines removed
```

